      },
      "message": "Merge origin/issue/4025-kernel-region (K1 review head e83a31076, with the law suite #4175) into issue/4178-kernel-entry-exit\n\nThe law suite takes the new EntryPlanner::entry signature: the stand-ins\nreturn a verdict, the kit keeps each entry verdict, and check_l4 reads\nthe entry fallbacks with entry::needs_fallback. The entry stage is\nregistered in the suite and passes L4 and L5.\n\nRefs #4178\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
